waitlog \[zpwg3\] done 20
> zpwg3 place 1104 -60 1040 powergrid:power_resistor facing=down
> zpwg3 scroll 1104 -60 1040 9
> zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1040 0 1104 -60 1040 0
> zpwg3 w 1104 -60 1040 1 1100 -60 1040 1
repeat 20
> zpwg3 be 1104 -60 1040
sleep 1
end
> zpwgg overheated 1104 -60 1040 1
waitlog \[zpwgg\] overheated \d+ 20
> zpwg3 be 1100 -60 1040
expect \[zpwgg\] overheated at 1104 -60 1040 original=Block\{powergrid:power_resistor\}
expect \[zpwg3\] terminals T0=40 T1=0\b
reject (?i)explo
reject \[zpwg\w*\] error
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
