@pass rotor `rpm=` near 256; `rotortest` (center about 1.1 blocks from the axis: about 4.7 damage a hit) loses health and dies within the 200 ticks: log `Named entity ... died: rotortest was killed in a generator accident` (or the key `death.attack.spinning_rotor` if the server has no mod lang), then `hp count 0`; `rotorcontrol` (outside the 1.3-block radius) keeps full health; no ERROR
