## SQ-PWG-48 | PWG-20 heater fan processing (blasting 50 V, smoking 38 V, cold), backstops in the streams, Dragon Breathing kept, Create fan through a 45 V coil, electric fan + dragon head
@group A
@commands PWG-20 and the pack's Dragon Breathing hook (memory `create-fan-processing-type`). Check `fanProcessingTime` in `OUT/srv/<level-name>/serverconfig/create-server.toml` (default 150). Heater line, Z 1400: `zpwg3 place 1100 -60 1400 powergrid:electric_fan facing=east`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1402 40`; wires source T0 to fan T0, fan T1 to source T1; `zpwg3 place 1102 -60 1400 powergrid:heating_coil facing=north`; `zpwg3 src 1102 -60 1403 50`; wires source T0 to coil T0, coil T1 to source T1; backstops so the items rest inside the streams (r1113 pwg10: they were blown past the stream end): `zpwg3 place 1109 -60 1400 minecraft:stone`, `zpwg3 place 1106 -60 1406 minecraft:stone`, `zpwg3 place 1105 -60 1410 minecraft:stone`; wait 600 ticks; `zpwg6 heater 1102 -60 1400`; `zpwg6 fan 1100 -60 1400` (if `flow=west`: `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1402 -40`); `zpwg6 fantype 1102 -60 1400`; `zpwg3 drop 1104 -60 1400 minecraft:raw_iron 1`; `cdevtest entities 1106 -60 1400 4 type=minecraft:item nbt` (the item rests at about 1108.7, against the stone) every 5 ticks for 30 ticks, then every 40 ticks for 240 ticks (the probe reads Create's processing data from the saved entity, `ForgeData/CreateData`: KubeJS's `getPersistentData` is its own tag). Smoking: `zpwg3 src 1102 -60 1403 38`, wait 600, `heater`, `fan`, `zpwg3 drop 1104 -60 1400 minecraft:beef 1`, `items` as before. Cold: `zpwg3 src 1102 -60 1403 0`, wait 600, `heater`, `fan`. Dragon line, Z 1406: `zpwg3 place 1098 -60 1406 create:creative_motor facing=east`; `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1406 64` (the 16 RPM default reaches about 1.25 blocks); `zpwg3 place 1099 -60 1406 create:encased_fan facing=east`; `zpwg3 place 1100 -60 1406 minecraft:dragon_wall_head facing=east`; `zpwg6 fan 1099 -60 1406` (if `flow=west`: `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1406 -64`); `zpwg6 fantype 1100 -60 1406`; `zpwg3 drop 1103 -60 1406 minecraft:apple 1`; `items 1104 -60 1406 4` every 40 ticks for 240 ticks. Create fan through a coil, Z 1410: creative motor (scrolled to 64 RPM) and encased fan as above at 1098 / 1099, `zpwg3 place 1101 -60 1410 powergrid:heating_coil facing=north`, `zpwg3 src 1101 -60 1413 45` wired to it; wait 600; `zpwg6 fan 1099 -60 1410`; `zpwg6 heater 1101 -60 1410`; `zpwg3 drop 1103 -60 1410 minecraft:raw_iron 1`, `items 1104 -60 1410 3` with the apple reads. Electric fan with a dragon head, Z 1414: electric fan at 1100 (40 V source at 1100 -60 1416 as above), `zpwg3 place 1101 -60 1414 minecraft:dragon_wall_head facing=east`; `zpwg6 fan 1100 -60 1414`
@pass heater line: coil `state=BLASTING`, `thermal T=` about 460 at 50 V (100 W; a fan's air current cools the coil by a factor 1 + 0.01 x RPM: 2.28 at 128 RPM, 1.64 at 64 RPM, steady T = 20 + P / (0.1 x factor), BLASTING needs T >= 400; upstream-same: upstream defines `IGNORE_EXTRA_COOLING` but no block sets it); `fan` speed 128 (reads 127.98), the stream after the coil `powergrid:heater_blasting`; `fantype` `powergrid:heater_blasting`; the raw iron rests against the stone inside the stream, shows `processing=powergrid:heater_blasting time=` at most 113 from the first read (151 x 0.75: `FanProcessingMixin`, entity path; without it up to 151) and turns into `minecraft:iron_ingot` within about 120 ticks (the Z 1410 raw iron too); smoking: `state=SMOKING`, T about 270 at 38 V (58 W), stream `powergrid:heater_smoking`, beef to `minecraft:cooked_beef`, time at most 113; cold: `state=COLD`, stream `none` after the coil; dragon line: stream `creativeengineering:dragon_breathing` after the head, the apple turns into `minecraft:chorus_fruit` (the pack's recipe), so the heater types did not displace the pack's type; Create fan through a coil: `state=BLASTING` (45 V, 81 W, T about 510) and stream `powergrid:heater_blasting` after the coil (upstream: heating coils serve Create fans too); electric fan with a dragon head: record the stream (the pack's type requires `create:encased_fan` behind the head, so `none` is expected; integration note); no ERROR
@fails heater state stays COLD: coil wiring (`be` terminals) or `CThermal.maxPower(60, 1.0)`; a stream without heater types: `HeaterFanProcessingTypes.register` not run (SQ-PWG-46 `check`) or the coil is not fan-transparent (`create:fan_transparent` tag in the jar); time above 113: `FanProcessingMixin` did not apply (`decrementProcessingTime` local ordinal) or `heaterFanProcessingSpeedMultiplier`; dragon breathing gone: compare a boot without the PG jar before blaming PG
