## SQ-PWG-50 | PWG-33 electric fan speed by voltage, pushes an item; chute push and pull (ChuteBlockEntityMixin)
@group A
@commands PWG-33 fan and `ChuteBlockEntityMixin`, Z 1440. `zpwg3 place 1100 -60 1440 powergrid:electric_fan facing=east`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1442 20` wired (T0 to T0, T1 to T1); wait 20; `zpwg6 fan 1100 -60 1440`; the same at 40 and 80 V; at 80 V `zpwg3 drop 1103 -60 1440 minecraft:cobblestone 1`, `cdevtest entities 1103 -60 1440 12 type=minecraft:item` now and after 40 ticks. Chute push: `zpwg3 place 1106 -60 1440 powergrid:electric_fan facing=up`, `zpwg3 place 1106 -59 1440 create:chute`, `zpwg3 src 1106 -60 1443 40` wired; `zpwg6 chute 1106 -59 1440`; `zpwg3 src 1106 -60 1443 0`, wait 20, `chute` again. Chute pull: `zpwg3 place 1109 -59 1440 create:chute`, `zpwg3 place 1109 -58 1440 powergrid:electric_fan facing=down`, `zpwg3 src 1109 -60 1443 40` wired to the fan; `zpwg6 chute 1109 -59 1440`
@pass `fan` speed 64 at 20 V, 128 at 40 V, 256 at 80 V (reads with decimals, e.g. 63.99 / 127.98 / 255.96; speed = current x 64, capped at 256; 20 ohm), `reach=` grows with speed, `flow=east` (or west with reversed polarity); the cobblestone moves east between the two reads (pushed by the electric fan's air current); chute push: `motion=` non-zero (upward, 0.1) while powered, no push unpowered (-0.2: the item falls; the HEAD inject in `calculatePush`); chute pull: `motion=` non-zero; no ERROR
@fails speed 0: wiring, or `motor.current()` before the circuit is built; motion 0 while powered: `ChuteBlockEntityMixin` (remap off, `calculatePush` / `calculatePull`; compressedcreativity also injects there, later in the method)
