## SQ-PWG-53 | PWG-22 growth lamp at noon with the daylight cycle off: lamp patch ahead of the open patch in summer and in winter (no season gate upstream)
@group A
@commands PWG-22 (records upstream behaviour: the lamp has no season gate), Z 1480 and 1490. Two patches: `fill 1098 -61 1478 1102 -61 1482 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]`, `setblock 1100 -61 1480 minecraft:water`, `fill 1098 -60 1478 1102 -60 1482 minecraft:wheat`, `setblock 1100 -60 1480 minecraft:air`; the same at Z 1488 to 1492 (centre 1100 -61 1490). Lamp over the first: `zpwg3 place 1100 -58 1480 powergrid:light_fixture facing=down`; `zpwg6 bulb 1100 -58 1480 powergrid:growth_lamp`; `zpwg3 src 1103 -60 1476 240` wired to the fixture; `time set 6000`, `gamerule doDaylightCycle false` (r1113 pwg10 ran this at night: the open patch never grew); `/season set MID_SUMMER`; `zpwg6 light 1100 -58 1480`; `cdevtest ages 1098 -60 1478 1102 -60 1482 minecraft:wheat` and `cdevtest ages 1098 -60 1488 1102 -60 1492 minecraft:wheat` now and every 200 ticks for 1200 ticks. Then `fill 1098 -60 1478 1102 -60 1482 minecraft:wheat` and the same for 1488 to 1492 (age 0 again, centres back to air), `time set 6000`, `gamerule doDaylightCycle false`, `/season set MID_WINTER` (upper case: the command takes the enum constant), the same reads for 1200 ticks; `gamerule doDaylightCycle true`
@pass lamp `power=2` (120 W at 240 V); summer: the lamp patch mean age about 3.6 after 1200 ticks (r1113 pwg10: 3.1; about 24 lamp ticks per block x about 0.15 growth chance; mean 7 is not reachable in 1200 ticks), about 3 stages ahead of the open patch, which grows a little in daylight (record); winter (wheat is temperate: off in winter): the lamp patch still ripens (record its rate against summer; the pack's season gate refuses about a quarter of growth checks through `CropGrowEvent.Pre`, which the lamp's `randomTick` also fires), the open patch slower than in summer; PWG-22's "does not grow out of season" is not met on the port (upstream has no gate; the integration stage decides, power_grid.md 14); no ERROR
@fails lamp patch no faster than the open one: bulb not lit (`light`), `growthLampChance` / `growthLampRadius`, tag `powergrid:affected_by_lamp` (`#minecraft:bee_growables`, cactus, sugar cane); no season effect at all on either patch: Creative Calendar's `CropSeasonGrowHookMixin` (crops.md 2.12.1), not Power Grid
