## CQ-PWG-16
@group client
@commands PWG-33 lights on the client and H5 (lights under the server-values-only switch). Client from CQ-PWG-15, same world: place a light fixture on the ground, `/give @s powergrid:light_bulb`, right-click the fixture with the bulb (offhand: a dye on a second fixture), a creative voltage source set to 120 V wired to it; screenshot lit (`RES/shots/CQ-PWG-16_on.png`); set the source to 0, screenshot at once and after 3 s (`_off0.png`, `_off3.png`); then quit the world, set `clientMirror = false` in the world's `serverconfig/powergrid-common.toml` (or `config/powergrid-common.toml`: the switch is a common config), reopen, repeat the three screenshots (`_mirror_off_*.png`)
