@pass drill on stone: first `digSpeed=6` (base), `correctTool=true`, the block breaks (`after=minecraft:air`), `charge` falls by 25 per block, `dur 250/250` unchanged; `digSpeedNow` and the next dig's `digSpeed` climb 8.5, 11, 13.5, 16 (`speedMult` 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1; top speed 16 = `drillMineSpeedBulk`) and stay at 16; `drops`: cobblestone; obsidian breaks and drops obsidian (diamond level); dirt `itemSpeed=6` (shovel blocks too), planks `itemSpeed=1` and `correctTool=false`; mining flag: `mining=true` after start, `false` after abort, `true` after start, `false` after stop (`DrillBreakActionMixin`), unchanged by the stick; empty battery: `charge 0`, `dur 249/250` (wear only without power) and `speedMult=0` after the dig (no power, no speed-up); no battery: `dur` falls by 1 too; saw: the log breaks with `itemSpeed=6`, `charge` -100; not sneaking only that log goes; sneaking: the rest of the tree falls (`drops` shows several `minecraft:oak_log` and the leaves' drops; no log left in the column), `charge` -100 more; stone `itemSpeed=1`; no ERROR
