@fails no projectile: `ElectroZapperItem.use` or the entity registration; no damage: `ZapProjectileEntity.onHitEntity` (zap source `ModdedDamageTypes.indirect`), Loading Protection (see the P7 notes); damage not shared: the entity box (`AABB(target.blockPosition()).inflate(2)`)
