@@text `#forge:cardboard`: loads, uncraftable until the pack fills that tag), the CC: Tweaked peripheral provider (voltage,
@@text current and power gauge, energy meter, battery, generator clutch, redstone converter; CC: Tweaked 1.101.4 is in the
@@text pack) and 5 ponder scenes (plotter, modular_display, bell, crt, punch_cards). No mixin. Port fixes to check: B15 (a
@@text card in a broken reader is dropped; upstream lost it), B16 (the display burnout packet runs on the client thread),
@@text B17 (the redstone converter's `setValue` / `clearValue` run on the server thread), and the modular display's value box
@@text (Create 0.5.1 has no `bypassesInput`: dye and wrench clicks on a slot center still reach the block, on both sides).
