## SQ-PWG-65 | PWG-39 plotter (buffer by RPM, samples, 16 RPM floor, dye), punch card reader (angle, bits, comparator, side insert, hopper), alarm bell, B15 card dropped
@group A
@commands PWG-39. Plotter, Z 1630: `zpwg3 place 1098 -60 1630 create:creative_motor facing=east`; `zpwg3 place 1099 -60 1630 create:shaft axis=x`; `zpwg3 place 1100 -60 1630 powergrid:plotter facing=north`; `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1630 64`; `zpwg3 scroll 1100 -60 1630 1` (20 V range); `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1633 10`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1633 0 1100 -60 1630 0`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1633 1 1100 -60 1630 1`; wait 100 ticks; `zpwg8 plot 1100 -60 1630 10`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1633 -10`, wait 40, `plot`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1633 30`, wait 40, `plot`; `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1630 32`, wait 20, `plot`; `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1630 8`, `plot` twice 20 ticks apart; `zpwg8 fp 1100 -60 1628`; `zpwg8 hold minecraft:red_dye`; `zpwg8 use 1100 -60 1630 up 0.5 0.75 0.5`; `plot`. Reader and bell, Z 1645: `zpwg3 place 1098 -60 1645 create:creative_motor facing=east`; `zpwg3 place 1099 -60 1645 create:shaft axis=x`; `zpwg3 place 1100 -60 1645 powergrid:punch_card_reader facing=north`; `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1645 -16`; `zpwg3 place 1103 -60 1645 powergrid:alarm_bell facing=north`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1649 10`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1649 0 1100 -60 1645 0` (common); `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1649 1 1103 -60 1645 1`; `zpwg3 w 1103 -60 1645 0 1100 -60 1645 1` (bit 1); `zpwg8 reader 1100 -60 1645`; `zpwg8 card 1100 -60 1645 01000100010001000100010001000100`; then every 8 ticks for 80 ticks `zpwg8 reader 1100 -60 1645` and `zpwg8 bell 1103 -60 1645`; after 300 ticks `reader`; `zpwg8 extract 1100 -60 1645`; side insert: `zpwg3 scroll 1098 -60 1645 16` (the other direction), `zpwg8 card 1100 -60 1645 ff000000000000000000000000000080 side`, `reader` every 16 ticks for 80. Hopper: `zpwg8 extract 1100 -60 1645`; `setblock 1100 -59 1645 minecraft:hopper[facing=down]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"powergrid:punch_card",Count:1b,tag:{Data:[B;1b,0b,1b,0b,1b,0b,1b,0b,1b,0b,1b,0b,1b,0b,1b,0b]}}]}`; wait 20, `reader`. B15: `setblock 1100 -59 1645 minecraft:air`; `setblock 1100 -60 1645 minecraft:air destroy`; `zpwg8 drops 1100 -60 1645 2`
