@@text `bmap` and record). Offline: the solver harness now has the board components' models (BoardComponentTests: diode,
@@text NPN, PNP, triode, pentode, thyratron, regulator tube; values in PORT_NOTES.md section 10); in-game values should match
@@text them within a few percent. B18 (power_grid.md 3.5): a tube that starts in cut-off reports converged while its
@@text operating point still walks for up to about 2 s (35 ticks); `zpwg9 watch` measures it.
@@text
@@text **Run order (high priority first):** SQ-PWG-67 (boot, registries, component_items, recipes), SQ-PWG-68 (resistor
@@text board through a current gauge, upstream's own boards load), SQ-PWG-06 (non-linear convergence: diode, NPN, PNP, triode,
@@text pentode, regulator tube, thyratron), CQ-PWG-22 (client: board rendering, sync line, ponder), SQ-PWG-69 (redstone relay,
@@text switch, capacitor on boards), SQ-PWG-70 (pick-block, place from item, drops, overheat and repair, fan cooling),
@@text CQ-PWG-23 (by hand: clicks on board parts, potentiometer screen, multimeter on a trace). SQ-PWG-71 (B19 regression)
@@text runs first if the P4 rows that crashed are being rerun.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-PWG-67 | -12 loads (phase 9.1): version, registries, 94 recipes, zpwg9 check (board, 19 items, 28 components, component_items, packets), ponder structures, reload
@group A
@commands copy the `-12` jar into `OUT/srv/mods/` (remove `backportedPowerGrid-*-11.jar` and older there) and the nine probes (`pwg_probe.js`, `pwg_grid_probe.js`, `pwg_p3_probe.js` to `pwg_p8_probe.js`, `pwg_p9a_probe.js` as `zz_*`) into `OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/`; the ponder datapack as in SQ-PWG-46 but from the `-12` jar (77 structure files now); boot; `forceload add 1090 1695 1130 1800`; `zpwg mods powergrid`; `zpwg ns powergrid`; `zpwg3 recipes powergrid`; `zpwg9 check`; `zpwg5 nbtall 1300 -60 1300` and `zpwg8 nbtall 1100 -60 1675` (as SQ-PWG-62); `grep -n -E 'component items\|Failed to parse component\|powergrid\.mixins\.json\|Mixin apply failed' logs/latest.log`; `reload`; the same grep
@pass `Done (`; `[zpwg] mod powergrid 0.6.2-ce-19.2-12`; log `(1.19.2 port, phase 9.1)`; `[zpwg] ns powergrid block: 67`, `item: 105`, `block_entity_type: 55`, `menu: 3`, `recipe_type: 1`, `recipe_serializer: 1`; `[zpwg3] recipes 94`, among them the 17 component recipes (`crafting/resistor`, `crafting/diode`, ... `crafting/pins`), `sequenced_assembly/bjt_npn` and `bjt_pnp`, and the 11 that waited for pins (`crafting/energy_meter`, `crafting/fe_inverter`, `crafting/heating_coil`, `crafting/light_fixture`, `crafting/lv_button`, `crafting/lv_switch`, `crafting/modular_display`, `crafting/redstone_converter`, `crafting/spark_gap`, `mechanical_crafting/generator_commutator`, `mechanical_crafting/punch_card_reader`); still absent: `crafting/circuit_design_table`, `deploying/schematic_copy`, `sequenced_assembly/battery`, `sequenced_assembly/unetched_circuit_board`, `sequenced_assembly/electrical_gizmo`, `mixing/acid`, the four `deploying/*_boosting`; `zpwg9 check`: `circuit_board registered=true item=true blockEntity=true`, `items p9a=19/19`, `items of P9b to P9d registered=` empty, `components 28:` with `barretter_tube bjt_npn bjt_pnp button capacitor connector current_gauge diode display_module fuse_holder inductor label light_bulb neon_bulb pentode potentiometer redstone_relay regulator_tube relay relay_dpdt resistor switch thyratron triode varistor vfet via voltage_gauge`, `component_items 28:` with among them `via->create:copper_nugget [#forge:nuggets/copper]`, `light_bulb->powergrid:lv_light_bulb`, `connector->powergrid:wire_connector`, `switch->powergrid:lv_switch`, `button->powergrid:lv_button`, `inductor->powergrid:copper_coil`, `label->minecraft:paper`; `mismatches=0`; `copper nugget -> powergrid:via`; `tag powergrid:circuit_component size=27` with `missing=[create:copper_nugget]` (the jar's tag file has 28 entries; Creative Common's `removed_items.js` removes `create:copper_nugget` from the pack, so the tag loads 27 there: not a port fault but a fold-in point, power_grid.md section 4; answered 2026-11-13 from `[zpwg9] tag powergrid:circuit_component missing=[create:copper_nugget] extra=[]`); `packets` ends with `DISPLAY_BURNOUT UPDATE_COMPONENT COMPONENT_ITEMS` (consecutive ordinals); `zpwg5` / `zpwg8` as SQ-PWG-62; log `Loaded 28 component items` once per data load (boot and after `reload`), no `Failed to parse component item`, no mixin error; no ERROR with `powergrid`
@fails wrong counts: the jar is not `-12` or `port_phase` is not 9.1 (`PortPhase.CURRENT`); `components 0`: `PowerGridImpl.newRegistry` (NewRegistryEvent) or `Components.register()` not called (`PowerGrid.register`); `component_items 0`: the reload listener (`PowerGridImpl.addReloadListeners`) or the folder `data/powergrid/powergrid/component_items` missing from the jar (`phases.json` resources glob); a missing recipe: `pg_phase_check.py` report (`phases.json` recipes overrides)
