## SQ-PWG-68 | PWG-42 (P9a part): resistor board through a current gauge, bset to 1 k, upstream's resistor and thyratron boards
@group A
@commands PWG-42 (P9a part: a board's circuit behaves as designed), Z 1700. `zpwg9 board 1100 -60 1700 resistor`; `zpwg3 place 1100 -60 1706 powergrid:current_gauge facing=north`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 1703 10`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1703 0 1100 -60 1706 0`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1706 1 1100 -60 1700 0`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 1703 1 1100 -60 1700 1`; wait 20; `zpwg3 be 1100 -60 1706`; `zpwg9 bcomp 1100 -60 1700`; `zpwg9 net 1100 -60 1700`; `zpwg9 bset 1100 -60 1700 5 6 resistor_value 1000`; wait 20; `be 1100 -60 1706`; `bcomp`. Upstream's boards: `zpwg9 ponder 1106 -60 1700 resistor`; `zpwg3 src 1106 -60 1703 10`; `zpwg3 w 1106 -60 1703 0 1106 -60 1700 0`; `zpwg3 w 1106 -60 1703 1 1106 -60 1700 1`; wait 20; `zpwg9 bcomp 1106 -60 1700`; `zpwg9 ponder 1112 -60 1700 thyratron` (bundles only)
@pass `board at 1100 -60 1700 state=Block{powergrid:circuit_board}[facing=north,rotation=0] components=3 terminals=2`; two bundles `connector@0,6#0* resistor@5,6#0` and `connector@11,6#0* resistor@5,6#1`; gauge about 0.1 A (10 V / 100 ohm, within 2 %; the board's pads and the wires add milliohms); `bcomp` `resistor@5,6 ... props[resistor_value=100.0 ...]`, `thermal` one unit above ambient (1 W in a 25 W part), terminals T0 - T1 about 10; `net converged=true`, `networkNodes` about 7 (the board's pad and junction nodes plus the gauge and source); after `bset`: `resistor_value=1000.0`, gauge about 0.01 A; upstream resistor board: 2 terminals, bundles to `resistor@6,6`, T0 - T1 = 10 V and the same 0.1 A path (record); thyratron board: `components=8`, 5 terminals (4 connectors and the thyratron's top cap), bundles listed with the two voltage gauges, no `error` (version 2 traces read)
@fails `terminals=0`: connectors not external (`ConnectorComponent.emitExternalTerminals`) or `BakedCircuit.makePadNodes`; no current: the traces (`bmap` shows a bundle with one pad: flood / `TraceMatrix` directions), the wire endpoints (`zpwg3 w` to a board terminal: `CircuitBoardBlockEntity.terminal`); `ponder ... error`: `CircuitSchematic.deserializeNbt` (legacy `FullPixelTraces`)
