## SQ-PWG-85 | rerun: boost by deployers (Unbreaking now on the probe tools): depot, no second boost, belt (saw, zapper)
@group A
@commands Boost by deployers (BoostRecipe on Create 0.5.1's `BeltDeployerCallbacks`, `RecipeApplierMixin`), Z 1930 and 1940, after SQ-PWG-84. Depot: `zpwg9c depot 1102 -60 1930`; `zpwg9d tool 1102 -60 1930 powergrid:portable_drill 30`; `zpwg9c deployer 1102 -58 1930 powergrid:integrated_circuit 2`; wait 120; `zpwg9d tag 1102 -60 1930`; `zpwg9c show 1102 -58 1930`; second depot (no second boost): `zpwg9c depot 1106 -60 1930 powergrid:electrobaton 1`; `zpwg9c deployer 1106 -58 1930 powergrid:integrated_circuit 3`; wait 200; `zpwg9d tag 1106 -60 1930`; `zpwg9c show 1106 -58 1930`. Belt: `zpwg9c line 1102 -60 1940 plain`; wait 10; `zpwg9c lineck 1102 -60 1940` (again after 5 ticks if it flipped the motor); `zpwg9c deployer 1106 -58 1940 powergrid:integrated_circuit 4`; `zpwg9c depot 1114 -60 1940`; wait 10; `zpwg9d tool 1102 -60 1940 powergrid:portable_saw 12 belt`; wait 200; `zpwg9d tag 1112 -60 1940`; `zpwg9c take 1112 -60 1940 1114 -60 1940`; `zpwg9c feed 1102 -60 1940 powergrid:electrozapper`; wait 200; `zpwg9d tag 1112 -60 1940`; `zpwg9c show 1106 -58 1940`
@pass depot: `tag 1102 -60 1930 0:powergrid:portable_drill x1 Boosted=75 Damage=30/250 name=zpwg9d unbreaking=1 ProbeKeep=1` (keys include `Boosted`, `Damage`, `display`, `Enchantments`, `ProbeKeep`); deployer hand `powergrid:integrated_circuit x1`; second depot: `powergrid:electrobaton x1 Boosted=6 Damage=0/20`, its deployer still `x2` after 200 ticks (a boosted tool is not boosted again: `BoostRecipe.matches`); belt: the saw reaches the end depot as `powergrid:portable_saw x1 Boosted=75 Damage=12/250 name=zpwg9d unbreaking=1 ProbeKeep=1`, then the zapper as `powergrid:electrozapper x1 Boosted=15 Damage=0/50`; the belt deployer `powergrid:integrated_circuit x2`; no ERROR
@fails tool unchanged and the chip kept: the deployer found no recipe (`zpwg9d check` `findRecipe`), or the deployer is not turning (`zpwg9c show` speed) or its hand is empty (the `hold deployer` line); `Boosted=75` but no `name` / `ProbeKeep`: `RecipeApplierMixin` boost branch; chip used twice on the baton: `BoostRecipe.matches`; the saw rides past: belt lock window (`zpwg3 scroll` the belt motor slower, as SQ-PWG-82)
@from batches/r1113pwg/pwgr1.qb
