## SQ-PWG-87 | boosted drill and saw (PlayerDrillMixin boost branch, SawItem.getDestroySpeed) against SQ-PWG-58
@group A
@commands Boosted drill and saw (`PlayerDrillMixin` boost branch, `SawItem.getDestroySpeed`) against SQ-PWG-58, Z 1950 and 1957, after SQ-PWG-84. Drill: `fill 1100 -60 1950 1106 -60 1950 minecraft:stone`; `zpwg7 fp 1100 -60 1947`; `zpwg7 wear 20000`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:portable_drill`; `zpwg9d drill0`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 dig 1100 -60 1950`, then 1101, 1102, 1103, 1104 (same Y and Z); `zpwg9d boosted`; expiry: `zpwg9d boost 1`; `zpwg7 dig 1105 -60 1950`; `zpwg9d boosted`; `zpwg7 dig 1106 -60 1950`. Saw: `setblock 1110 -60 1957 minecraft:oak_log`; `setblock 1112 -60 1957 minecraft:stone`; `zpwg7 fp 1110 -60 1953`; `zpwg7 wear 20000`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:portable_saw`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 dig 1110 -60 1957`; `zpwg7 dig 1112 -60 1957`; `zpwg9d boosted`
@pass `drill0 speedMult=0`; `boost [zpwg7] powergrid:portable_drill x1 Boosted=75 Damage=0/250`; drill digs: `digSpeed` 12, 17, 22, 27, 32 (twice SQ-PWG-58's 6, 8.5, 11, 13.5, 16; the speed-up per block is the same), each block breaks, `charge` falls by 50 per block (SQ-PWG-58: 25), `dur 250/250` unchanged; `boosted ... Boosted=70 ... speedMult=1`; expiry: the dig at 1105 starts at `digSpeed=32` and ends with `digSpeedNow=16`, then `boosted ... Boosted=none` (the last boosted use removes the tag and plays the item-break event); the dig at 1106 `digSpeed=16`, `charge` -25; saw: the log `itemSpeed=12` (SQ-PWG-58: 6), `charge` -200 (SQ-PWG-58: -100); stone `itemSpeed=2` (SQ-PWG-58: 1); `boosted ... Boosted=73`; no ERROR
@fails `digSpeed` 6 with `Boosted=75`: `PlayerDrillMixin.powerGrid$adjustDrillDigSpeed` (`ItemBoostUtils.isBoosted` on the main hand); speeds start at 32: `drill0` failed (the level from SQ-PWG-58 stays: the fake player never ticks); charge -25: `DrillItem.mineBlock` `useBoost`; `Boosted` never drops: `useBoost`
