## SQ-PWG-88 | rerun on pigs: boosted Electro-Baton (20 and 26 max health) and Electro-Zapper (single, chain, low power, empty) against SQ-PWG-59 / -60
@group A
@commands Boosted Electro-Baton and Electro-Zapper against SQ-PWG-59 / -60, Z 1965 and 1975, after SQ-PWG-84. Baton: `summon minecraft:villager 1100 -60 1965 {NoAI:1b}`; `summon minecraft:witch 1104 -60 1965 {NoAI:1b}`; `zpwg7 fp 1100 -60 1963`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:electrobaton`; `zpwg7 wear 20000`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 baton 2`; `zpwg9d boosted`; witch: `zpwg7 fp 1104 -60 1963`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:electrobaton`; `zpwg7 wear 20000`; `zpwg7 baton 2`; `effect clear @e[type=minecraft:witch]`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 baton 2`. Zapper single: `summon minecraft:villager 1100 -60 1975 {NoAI:1b}`; `zpwg7 fp 1100 -60 1968`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:electrozapper`; `zpwg7 wear 20000`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 hp 1100 -60 1975 2`; `zpwg7 zap 10`; wait 20; `zpwg7 hp 1100 -60 1975 2`. Chain: `summon minecraft:villager 1110 -60 1975 {NoAI:1b}`, the same at 1111 -60 1975 and 1110 -60 1976; `zpwg7 fp 1110 -60 1968`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:electrozapper`; `zpwg7 wear 20000`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 hp 1110 -60 1975 3`; `zpwg7 zap 10`; wait 20; `zpwg7 hp 1110 -60 1975 3`; low power: `zpwg7 wear 6000`; `zpwg7 zap 10`; wait 20; `zpwg7 hp 1110 -60 1975 3`. Empty: `kill @e[type=!minecraft:player,x=1090,y=-64,z=1960,dx=30,dy=10,dz=25]`; `summon minecraft:villager 1100 -60 1975 {NoAI:1b}`; `zpwg7 fp 1100 -60 1968`; `zpwg7 hold powergrid:electrozapper`; `zpwg7 wear 0`; `zpwg9d boost`; `zpwg7 hp 1100 -60 1975 2`; `zpwg7 zap 10`; wait 20; `zpwg7 hp 1100 -60 1975 2`; `zpwg9d boosted`
@pass baton, villager (20 health): `slowness amp=10 dur=120` (SQ-PWG-59: `amp=10 dur=60`), `charge 20000 -> 19750` (unchanged per hit), `boosted ... Boosted=5`; witch (26 health): unboosted `amp=4 dur=60` ((30 - 26) x 1), boosted `amp=10 dur=120` ((60 - 26) x 1, capped at 10); zapper single: `zap projectile power=2` (SQ-PWG-60: 1), `charge 20000 -> 19500` (unchanged), the villager loses 16 (20 -> 4; SQ-PWG-60: 8); chain (deltas from the `hp` read before each zap): each of the three loses about 5.333 (SQ-PWG-60: 2.667); low power (6 000, output 0.6): `power=1.2`, now above 0.6, so all three lose 3.2 (SQ-PWG-60: only the target, 1.6); empty: `power=1` (SQ-PWG-60: 0.5), the villager loses 8 (SQ-PWG-60: 4), `dur 50/50 -> 49/50`, `boosted ... Boosted=14`; no ERROR (the fake player's missing connection line after a zap, as SQ-PWG-60)
@fails baton `dur=60` with a boost: `ElectroBatonItem.hurtEnemy` `useBoost`; zapper `power=1` at full charge with a boost: `ElectroZapperItem.use` (`useBoost` before the chip check); villager health odd: MCA villagers (record their max health; the deltas count)
