## SQ-PWG-92 | ceiling tile lamp on the grid: 120 V lamp_on, 60 V, 0 V, LV bulb at 12 V
@group A
@commands Ceiling tile lamp on the grid (as SQ-PWG-52's fixture), Z 2020, after SQ-PWG-90. `zpwg3 place 1100 -58 2020 powergrid:ceiling_tile`; `zpwg10 attach 1100 -58 2020 powergrid:factory_light`; `zpwg6 bulb 1100 -58 2020 powergrid:light_bulb`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 2023 120`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 2023 0 1100 -58 2020 0`; `zpwg3 w 1100 -60 2023 1 1100 -58 2020 1`; `zpwg10 lamp 1100 -58 2020` every 20 ticks for 120 ticks; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 2023 60`, wait 200, `lamp`; `zpwg3 src 1100 -60 2023 0`, wait 200, `lamp`. LV: `zpwg3 place 1104 -58 2020 powergrid:ceiling_tile`; `zpwg10 attach 1104 -58 2020 powergrid:factory_light`; `zpwg6 bulb 1104 -58 2020 powergrid:lv_light_bulb`; `zpwg3 src 1104 -60 2023 12` wired the same (T0 to T0, T1 to T1); wait 200; `lamp 1104 -58 2020`
@pass 120 V: `state=lamp_on` within 120 ticks, `T=` about 1450 (as SQ-PWG-52's fixture), `emission=15`, `below=` 14 or 15, terminals T0 - T1 = 120; 60 V: `lamp` or `lamp_low_power` with `emission` 0 or 10 (record; the same power level as SQ-PWG-52's fixture at 60 V); 0 V: `state=lamp`, `emission=0`; LV bulb at 12 V: `state=lamp_low_power`, `emission=10`; no ERROR
@fails `state=empty` with a bulb: the bulb did not load (`zpwg6 bulb` saved-data route) or `setPowerLevel` never ran (no power change yet: step the voltage); `emission=0` at `lamp_on`: the light level map in `CeilingTileLampBlock` (`ILightBulb.LIGHT_LEVEL_*`); no current: the lamp's filament switch (`buildCircuit`)
