## SQ-PWG-96 | P10 deploying recipes by machines (copper plating, string light cord); design table and solar panel bearing craftable
@group A
@commands P10 deploying recipes by machines, design table and solar bearing, Z 2070 and 2080, after SQ-PWG-90 (needs `zz_pwg_p9c_probe.js`). `zpwg9c depot 1100 -60 2070 minecraft:copper_block 1`; `zpwg9c deployer 1100 -58 2070 immersiveengineering:plate_copper 2` (the pack's `#forge:plates/copper`); `zpwg9c depot 1106 -60 2070 powergrid:copper_cord 1`; `zpwg9c deployer 1106 -58 2070 powergrid:light_bulb 2`; wait 120; `zpwg9c show 1100 -60 2070`; `zpwg9c show 1106 -60 2070`; `zpwg9c show 1100 -58 2070`; `zpwg9c show 1106 -58 2070`. Crafting: `zpwg3 recipes powergrid` lines for `crafting/circuit_design_table` and `crafting/solar_panel_bearing` (output, type)
@pass depot 1100: `powergrid:copper_plating x1`, its deployer `immersiveengineering:plate_copper x1`; depot 1106: `powergrid:string_light_cord x1`, its deployer `powergrid:light_bulb x1`; both crafting recipes listed with outputs `powergrid:circuit_design_table` and `powergrid:solar_panel_bearing` (`minecraft:crafting_shaped`; their ingredients resolve: `zpwg10 check` `unresolved=[]`); no ERROR
